{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46初の個別握手会 in 名古屋\n無事終了しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方、\n会えて嬉しかったあああぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別は始めてだったので、\nちょと不安だったけども\nみなさんの顔を見れただけで\n安心しちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服はこんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パステルな乃木色と白ワンピで\n春っぽいんやけど\n私がしてる小物はいっつもゴツいの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスマッチなコーデです。きらーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りのトカゲちゃん\nつけてたんだよ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛でちょうど隠れてたから\n「みて‼これトカゲ‼」\nて自分で見せてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにきもちわるがられたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉とれいかには特にね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くわっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トカゲちゃんかわいいよぉー:D‼\nなでなで   ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はどんな服着よっかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山おしゃべりして\nにぎにぎできて本当によかった‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分から上手くことばを\n伝えられたかな><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとみなさんと仲良くなりたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと知ってもらえるように\nいつもの私を出せたらいいな‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にパワーもらったというか。\n元気をもらいました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にぎにぎ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/25/4699998/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の全握、個握も楽しみ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のスタジアムライブ\nみさの分も全力で頑張ります‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}